# Imported Skills — External Origin

Purpose:
  Registry of skills imported from external repositories. Each subdirectory
  is a skill adapted to .sdd format with mandatory provenance:
  Source (repo URL), Origin (local path in tmp/), Imported (date),
  Format, Runtime. Per CLAUDE.md "External skill import rules":
  code-bearing skills are analyzed/run via Docker only ([R59]-[R66]).

Owns: ./

Source: https://github.com/anthropics/skills (+ BuilderIO, khasky, artemrudenko — round 2)
Origin: tmp/skills/skills/ (round 1) + web fetch (round 2, 2026-09-06)
Imported: 2026-09-06 (round 1: anthropics 7; round 2: governance/orchestration/audit 9)
Format: anthropic-skill (SKILL.md, adapted via INDEX.sdd wrappers)
License: MIT and Apache-2.0 (per-skill; see individual wrappers)

Skills:
  canvas-design:
    one_line: Interactive HTML canvas art and visual composition
    runtime: browser (JS)
    code: N (templates only)

  doc-coauthoring:
    one_line: Collaborative document drafting and co-authoring workflow
    runtime: none (docs-only)
    code: N

  frontend-design:
    one_line: Frontend UI/UX design heuristics and visual craft
    runtime: none (docs-only)
    code: N

  mcp-builder:
    one_line: Model Context Protocol server scaffolding and tooling
    runtime: python3 (anthropic + mcp SDKs) — Docker-gated
    code: Y (analysis runs in Docker only)

  skill-creator:
    one_line: Author, package, and eval agent skills (agent-skills spec)
    runtime: python3 (eval harness) — Docker-gated
    code: Y (analysis runs in Docker only)

  theme-factory:
    one_line: Design theme system with 10 curated themes
    runtime: none (docs-only, 10 theme files)
    code: N

  webapp-testing:
    one_line: Playwright-based web app testing patterns and server helpers
    runtime: python3 + playwright — Docker-gated
    code: Y (analysis runs in Docker only)

Groups (round 2, 2026-09-06 research integration):
  skill-governance:
    source: https://github.com/artemrudenko/skill-governance-toolkit (MIT)
    skills: skill-evaluate (D1-D9 scoring), library-audit, skill-build-portable
    registry: @skill-governance/INDEX.sdd

  orchestration:
    source: https://github.com/BuilderIO/skills (MIT, repo-level)
    skills: agent-watchdog, plan-arbiter, efficient-frontier, quick-recap
    registry: @orchestration/INDEX.sdd

  audit:
    source: https://github.com/khasky/awesome-agent-skills (MIT)
    skills: awesome-design-doc, awesome-architecture-audit
    registry: @audit/INDEX.sdd

Rules:
  [IMP1] Every imported skill MUST carry Source + Origin + Imported + Format in its INDEX.sdd.
  [IMP2] Code-bearing skills MUST declare Runtime and MUST be executed/analyzed inside Docker.
  [IMP3] Imported skills are candidates (Phase 146 lifecycle: EXTERNAL â†’ CANDIDATE â†’ ACTIVE).
  [IMP4] Human review required for CANDIDATE â†’ ACTIVE promotion.
  [IMP5] Original SKILL.md content is preserved verbatim — adaptation happens via INDEX.sdd wrapper.
  [IMP6] License check is mandatory before import: MIT/Apache only; source-available â‰  importable.
  [IMP7] New imports MUST pass skill-evaluate (governance skill) before CANDIDATE â†’ ACTIVE.

